{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210283-2e-what-can-a-deathlord-get-you-from-madame-marthesine-of-the-lost","id":1210283,"title":"2E: What can a Deathlord get you from Madame Marthesine of the Lost?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-22T22:11:02-07:00","id":1210283,"title":"2E: What can a Deathlord get you from Madame Marthesine of the Lost?","content":"You have a Deathlord, but no way to just shove him into the Void and be done with it. But then Madame Marthesine, Goddess of Lost Things, shows up and suggests just shoving him into her sack. Considering all that she has to give versus all the secrets a Deathlord knows and the power it possesses, what do you demand first in exchange?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T23:06:28-07:00","id":1210298,"title":"","content":"Those lost concepts that can no longer even be comprehended because some jerk burnt their very existence from reality after the people stuffing them in prison failed to properly restrain them them from clacking a few of their thousand spheres together","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T10:57:23-07:00","id":1210490,"title":"","content":"Wait, do those still exist within Creation? I\u2019m pretty sure those things are as lost as if they had been chucked into the Void.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T11:26:47-07:00","id":1210500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210283-2e-what-can-a-deathlord-get-you-from-madame-marthesine-of-the-lost#post1210283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But then Madame Marthesine, Goddess of Lost <i><b>Things</b></i></div> </div> </div> </div>Emphasis mine. A Deathlord is technically more of a person than object, nobody's possession, except maybe for some Neverborn - and even that is debatable - who are not of Creation, to say the least. So, i guess it wouldn't work like that.<br /> <br /> Same issue with <b>concepts</b> or <b>places</b>, i would guess (but there's nothing to say gods of these do not exist - and might compete, friendly or not, with Marthesine on a number of possible issues of intersection of their purviews).<br /> <br /> Would ruins count as lost places? If so, Amoth City-Smiter might count as that &quot;counterpart deity&quot;.<br /> If not, there's certainly room for conflict between him and a god of lost places.<br /> <br /> As an aside and - sort of - back on the initial subject, what would happen if an Exalt managed somehow to seriously own a Deathlord with the <i>Forgotten Blade</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 04-23-2018, 02:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T11:45:47-07:00","id":1210508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210283-2e-what-can-a-deathlord-get-you-from-madame-marthesine-of-the-lost?p=1210490#post1210490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, do those still exist within Creation? I\u2019m pretty sure those things are as lost as if they had been chucked into the Void.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure, but I couldn't think of much else that would be worth as much as a Deathlord while being some sort of lost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T13:00:30-07:00","id":1210555,"title":"","content":"As an aside, wouldn't ridding the PCs of the Deathlord permanently count as compensation on itself? Yes, kind of zero sum game, but mutually advantageous anyway.<br /> <br /> Honestly, a dreamstone or somesuch with all its memories and knowledge should be value aplently.<br /> But if one wants to ask for crazy, off-the-wall stuff... the chosen of a fallen/lost Incarna.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T13:25:53-07:00","id":1210569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210283-2e-what-can-a-deathlord-get-you-from-madame-marthesine-of-the-lost?p=1210500#post1210500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Emphasis mine. A Deathlord is technically more of a person than object, nobody's possession, except maybe for some Neverborn - and even that is debatable - who are not of Creation, to say the least. So, i guess it wouldn't work like that.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not quite. According to her write up she apparently has Terrestrial and Celestial gods in her sack, and the Celestial Bureaucracy can\u2019t even give their roles to different gods so long as Marthesine has them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T13:43:48-07:00","id":1210578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210283-2e-what-can-a-deathlord-get-you-from-madame-marthesine-of-the-lost?p=1210569#post1210569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not quite. According to her write up she apparently has Terrestrial and Celestial gods in her sack, and the Celestial Bureaucracy can\u2019t even give their roles to different gods so long as Marthesine has them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, found the fragment - and it seems to actually mean charms she has taken (lost) from terrestrial or celestial gods as per her price in bargains.<br /> Taking people into her sack seems to apply to thieves who dare to put their hands into it.<br /> <br /> Also, both this and how much her purview covers seems to be 2e fluff evolution, at least comparing the RoGD1 and the GoD write-ups.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T20:07:11-07:00","id":1210774,"title":"","content":"...so, um.<br /> <br /> I strongly recommend AGAINST this plan.<br /> <br /> If there's a Deathlord, giving them access to everything else Madame Marthesine has in her sack is...like, the WORST POSSIBLE IDEA. You should consider carefully the possibility that this Deathlord is using a high Intelligence and Manipulation score and centuries of malicious cunning to pull a Brer Rabbit on you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T20:49:56-07:00","id":1210785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1210283-2e-what-can-a-deathlord-get-you-from-madame-marthesine-of-the-lost?p=1210774#post1210774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...so, um.<br /> <br /> I strongly recommend AGAINST this plan.<br /> <br /> If there's a Deathlord, giving them access to everything else Madame Marthesine has in her sack is...like, the WORST POSSIBLE IDEA. You should consider carefully the possibility that this Deathlord is using a high Intelligence and Manipulation score and centuries of malicious cunning to pull a Brer Rabbit on you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I find it unlikely that most 2E Deathlords would manage that besides the Silver Prince and that one guy who is too busy screwing with his own death knights for having the same exaltation as some jerks he used to know to do anything else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}